<title>USA: Medical Technology fy97 net shr $2.27.</title>
<headline>Medical Technology fy97 net shr $2.27.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medical Technology Systems, Inc full year results for fiscal year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			    1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		  $2.27     loss	 $8.52</p>
<p> Net profit		$13,012     loss     $34,580</p>
<p> Revs			$19,247		  $17,052</p>
<p>  Avg shrs		   5,737		    4,059</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Medical Technology reported net income of $13 million, or $2.27 per share for the fiscal year ending March 31, 1997, compared to a loss of $34.6 million dollars or $8.52 per share a year ago. Revenues rose 13 percent to $19.2 million from $17 million last year.</p>
<p>&quot;We completed a complicated restructuring in the second quarter which facilitated the emergence of our major operating subsidiaries from bankruptcy proceedings in just eight months,&quot; said chief executive Todd Siegel.</p>
</text>
